    <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-392" contextRef="c-124">PJM is an regional transmission organization and independent system operator responsible for coordinating the operation and planning of and movement of wholesale electricity on the bulk power system in the PJM region on behalf of the Members of PJM, in all or parts of DE, IL, IN, KY, MD, MI, NJ, NC, OH, PA, TN, VA, WV, and the District of Columbia, and the administration and operation of wholesale capacity, energy and ancillary service markets, as further discussed in more detail in footnote 1.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
